## Working with this repository

Browse the documents on GitHub or download the repository. Use a compatible Word document viewer to read the `.docx` files, an image viewer for the diagram preview, and diagrams.net for the editable UML source.

There is currently no application installation, server startup command, dependency manifest, or automated test suite in this repository. Runtime setup instructions should be added alongside the application source when implementation is introduced.

When proposing documentation changes:

- Identify the affected user stories and acceptance criteria.
- Keep the SRS, use case analysis, diagrams, and feature reports consistent.
- Distinguish proposed behavior from implemented or experimentally verified behavior.
- Update document versions and README links when files are renamed or replaced.

## Implementation planning

The documents provide a basis for agreeing the scope, resolving permissions and integration decisions, selecting providers and deployment options, and planning implementation. Quality targets and evaluation plans still require validation on representative lecture material. Consult the individual reports for their proposed stages and open questions.
